api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/deployments","created_at":"2014-09-18T16:12:01Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T08:09:26Z","pushed_at":"2026-03-10T23:39:43Z","git_url":"git://github.com/angular/angular.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:angular/angular.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular","homepage":"https://angular.dev","size":616697,"stargazers_count":100153,"watchers_count":100153,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":27109,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1141,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["angular","javascript","pwa","typescript","web","web-framework","web-performance"],"visibility":"public","forks":27109,"open_issues":1141,"watchers":100153,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"<!--\nIF YOU DON'T FILL OUT THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION WE MIGHT CLOSE YOUR ISSUE WITHOUT INVESTIGATING\n-->\n\n**I'm submitting a ...**\n\n```\n[ x ] bug report => search github for a similar issue or PR before submitting\n[ ] feature request\n[ ] support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\n```\n\n**Current behavior**\nI have two nested components - parent and child, both with separate resolvers. Here is the routing config:\n\n``` javascript\nconst routes = [\n{\n    path: '',\n    redirectTo: '/parent/1',\n    pathMatch: 'full'\n},\n{\n    path: 'parent',\n    resolve: {\n        parent: ParentResolver\n    },\n    children: [\n        { path: '',  component: ParentComponent },\n        {\n            path: ':child',\n            component: ChildComponent,\n            resolve: {\n                child: ChildResolver\n            }\n        }\n    ]\n}];\n\n```\n\nWhen entering directly the URL corresponding to the child component `'/parent/1',` , the two resolvers start resolving concurrently. This leads to a conflict, when `ChildResolver` depends on a state modification, made by its parent component's `ParentResolver`.\n\n**Expected behavior**\nWhen entering directly the URL corresponding to the child component `'/parent/1',` , the expected behavior is that the `ParentResolver` will get resolved first, and after that `ChildResolver` resolution will take place. \n\n**Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions**\n\n<!--\nIf the current behavior is a bug or you can illustrate your feature request better with an example, \nplease provide the *STEPS TO REPRODUCE* and if possible a *MINIMAL DEMO* of the problem via\nhttps://plnkr.co or similar (you can use this template as a starting point: http://plnkr.co/edit/tpl:AvJOMERrnz94ekVua0u5).\n-->\n1. Go to [plunker](http://plnkr.co/edit/qt2SmbWjxE8tQMejK3jm?p=preview)\n2. Open browser's console and you will see that the `ChildResolver` has finished before `ParentResolver`. If you look at their implementation you will see, that the `ChildResolver` resolution timeout is shorter than the resolution timeout of `ParentResolver`, which means that the resolvers are concurrent.\n\n**What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?**\n\n<!-- Describe the motivation or the concrete use case -->\n\nThis looks as a valid routing configuration that should be supported.\n\n**Please tell us about your environment:**\n\n<!-- Operating system, IDE, package manager, HTTP server, ... -->\n- **Angular version:** 2.0.X\n  \n  <!-- Check whether this is still an issue in the most recent Angular version -->\n- **Browser:** [all | Chrome XX | Firefox XX | IE XX | Safari XX | Mobile Chrome XX | Android X.X Web Browser | iOS XX Safari | iOS XX UIWebView | iOS XX WKWebView ]\n  \n  <!-- All browsers where this could be reproduced -->\n- **Language:** [all | TypeScript X.X | ES6/7 | ES5]\n- **Node (for AoT issues):** `node --version` =   \n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/12148/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/12148/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/529690248","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/12032#issuecomment-529690248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/12032","id":529690248,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyOTY5MDI0OA==","user":{"login":"angular-automatic-lock-bot[bot]","id":54863671,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTQ4NjM2NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/40213?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/angular-automatic-lock-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angular-automatic-lock-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.gi